      Q. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقَوْصَرَ</span></b> , said of a man, (M,) <i>He
became contracted;</i> lit., <i>one part of him entered
into another part;</i> (M, K;) <i>as though he became
like a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْصَرَّة</span>, from which word the verb is derived. (Z, TA.) ― 
